  1405	### Kaggriculture Test Surface
  1406	
  1407	The retained 41 library unit tests exercise configuration/numeric behavior,
  1408	market ordering, native reset/randomness, terminal behavior, transactional
  1409	failure rollback, and economic/attribution counters including state neutrality.
  1410	Nine RNG integration tests use embedded CPython vectors, including large and
  1411	negative seeds, rollover and long streams. These 50 tests do not read episodes.
  1412	
  1413	Task 1.1 added nine `tests/replay_parity.rs` tests: four replay tests, a public
  1414	API test, and four comparator regressions. Task 1.1b extends the file to 16
  1415	(see [live differential parity](#kaggriculture-live-differential-parity)). The API test covers decoded PASS
  1416	commands, public state, terminal banks, and economic/attribution counters.
  1417	Comparator tests reject private inventory and private field insertion-order
  1418	drift, public market-map insertion-order drift, and public integer-versus-float
  1419	drift. Replay tests compare complete public and private state, the key order of
  1420	every object at every depth of both (market inventory/prices, shed, seeds,
  1421	inventories), statuses, typed `Vec<f64>` rewards, step/done and terminal banks. Typed rewards accommodate recorded `[0,0]` versus
  1422	serialized `[0.0,0.0]` without relaxing public market-number comparisons.
  1423	
  1424	Each replay constructs `Game::new(config, seed, 2)` directly. No expected initial
  1425	state, RNG/shop schedule or final bank value is injected into the constructor.
  1426	System `gzip -dc` reads each pinned trace; decompression or fixture failures are
  1427	hard failures. Each episode has 719 transitions and 720 checked snapshots
  1428	(initial plus successors): **2,876 transitions and 2,880 snapshots** overall.
