  1632	  kaggle-environments 1.32.7 in an isolated uv environment, and
  1633	  `engine_rs/tests/replay_parity.rs` replays the traces with `replay_text`.
  1634	- **Discriminating observation:** the first differing line, step and field.
  1635	- **Stopping condition:** every trace agrees, or each divergence is minimized,
  1636	  kept and documented without editing the pinned kernel.
